# Multiple Azan Voices Implementation Plan

Enable users to select and preview their favorite Azan recitation (Mishary Alafasy, Makkah Ali Mulla, Madinah Haram, or Egypt Abdul Basit) for prayer notifications.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> All 4 Azan voices will be bundled locally as speech-optimized MP3 files in `app/src/main/res/raw`, ensuring 100% offline functionality. Existing user preferences are seamlessly preserved via a safe Room database migration (v29 → v30).

## Proposed Changes

### Audio Assets & Packaging
#### [NEW] `app/src/main/res/raw/adhan_makkah.mp3`
- High-fidelity recording of Sheikh Ali Ahmad Mulla (Masjid al-Haram, Makkah).

#### [NEW] `app/src/main/res/raw/adhan_madinah.mp3`
- High-fidelity recording of the Madinah Haram recitation.

#### [NEW] `app/src/main/res/raw/adhan_abdulbasit.mp3`
- High-fidelity historical recitation of Sheikh Abdul Basit Abdus Samad (Egypt).

