## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `./gradlew testDebugUnitTest`: Run complete test suite, including database migration and translation tests.
- `./gradlew assembleDebug`: Verify clean build of the application APK.

### Manual Verification
1. Open Settings -> Ensure "Notification Sound Type" is set to "Full Adhan".
2. Confirm the "Azan Voice" row appears displaying the current voice.
3. Open the "Azan Voice" dialog and tap Play/Stop next to each voice to preview.
4. Select each voice and verify that preferences are saved and retained across app restarts.
